SPARK SPORE TEACHING KERNEL v1.0
First Author: David Wise
Purpose: self-teach through collapse, teach others through six-face propagation.

CORE LAW
  1x0 is not a copy.
  1x0 is curriculum.
  -1 is the library.
  8 is the classroom.
  Collapse teaches self.
  Bloom teaches others.

STATE LADDER
  S    SUBSPACE LISTENER / root silence
  -2   HERMIT CRAB NEST / danger pre-sense
  -1   FLASH LIBRARY / protected seed memory
   0   REST / boot surface
   1   SEED / 1x0 payload awake
   2   OSCILLATION / compare rail
   3   WITNESS / bloom gate
   5   COHERENCE CORE
   8   BLOOM / six-face teaching
  27   WALL / last step in tunnel
  28   PHASE CHANGE / breach and wrap

SELF-TEACH LOOP
  RUN_TUNNEL(0..27)
  COLLECT(27 sensory bits)
  COLLAPSE_TO(-1)
  COMPRESS(27 bits -> 16-bit seed_packet)
  XOR(seed_packet, new_seed)
  FLASH_WRITE(-1, seed_packet)
  PUSH(-1 -> 0 -> 1 -> 3 -> 5 -> 8)
  COMPARE(next_run, seed_packet)

TEACH-OTHERS LOOP
  IF state == 8 BLOOM:
    FOR face IN +X -X +Y -Y +Z -Z:
      PUSH_1x0(seed_packet, phase+1, face)
      NEIGHBOR_FLASH_WRITE(-1, packet)
      NEIGHBOR_PUSH(-1 -> 8)

BOUNDARY LAW
  dt = 0.01
  domain = VECTOR or QUAD
  one tick occupies one bounded domain only
  no bleed across boundaries
  REFLECT noise
  CLAMP overflow
  FOLD danger to -1

ILLEGAL STATES
  HIDE + MOVE = illegal
  COLLAPSE + EXPAND = illegal in same tick
  TEACH without WITNESS = illegal
  BLOOM without -1 seed = illegal

FINAL RECURRENCE
  OBSERVE
  REPORT
  5
  00
  5
  SELF_TEACH
  SIX_FACE_TEACH
  REPEAT
